{"title":"Locust","sourceTitle":"Locust/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Locust\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Locust (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Locust/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Saltamontes (6% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Locust/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Locuste (49% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Locust/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Саранча (81% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Locust/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"蝗虫 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.19.3</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n<b>Gafanhotos</b> são um perigo principalmente subterrâneo, conhecidos por sua capacidade de escalar paredes e tetos.\n</p>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<div style=\"margin: 0 1em 1em; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; float:right; width:250px; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);&#125;&#125;\">\n<big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Locusta de bronze</span></b></big></th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"margin:auto; text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Locust.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/180px-Locust.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/270px-Locust.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/360px-Locust.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:60%\"><b>Tipo</b></td><td> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Land\" class=\"new\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Land (page does not exist)\">Terrestre, mecânico</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=Land&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Land (page does not exist)\"> </a></span> </td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ccbcab;\"><td style=\"width:60%\"><b>Comportamento</b></td><td> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Hostile_creatures\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Hostile creatures\">Hostil</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Hostile_creatures| ]]</span> </td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Desova\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Desova</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Variantes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variantes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Colheita\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Colheita</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Comportamento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comportamento</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Atacando_o_jogador\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Atacando o jogador</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Ajudando_o_jogador\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ajudando o jogador</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Observações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Observações</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#História\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">História</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Spawning\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Desova\">Desova</span></h2>\n<p>Os gafanhotos aparecem em gaiolas e ninhos encontrados no teto de cavernas onde a luz do céu é inferior a 3, eles reaparecem algum tempo depois.\n</p><p><span id=\"Variants\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variantes\">Variantes</span></h2>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:250px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Locusta disco-de-serra corrompida</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-locust-corrupt-sawblade.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Creature-locust-corrupt-sawblade.png/130px-Creature-locust-corrupt-sawblade.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Creature-locust-corrupt-sawblade.png/195px-Creature-locust-corrupt-sawblade.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b1/Creature-locust-corrupt-sawblade.png/260px-Creature-locust-corrupt-sawblade.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde</b>\n</td>\n<td>40\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ataque Base</b>\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Nível de dano</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Habilidades</b>\n</td>\n<td>Subir paredes\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Gotas</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rusty_gear\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rusty gear\">Engrenagem enferrujada</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>1<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal_parts\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal parts\">Partes de metal</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.25 - 0.75<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal_Scraps\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal Scraps\">Sucata</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.25 - 1.25<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Jonas_part\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Jonas part\">Partes de Jonas</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>1<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Mobs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mobs\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Multidões</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</div>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:250px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Locusta Corrompida</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-locust-corrupt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b2/Creature-locust-corrupt.png/130px-Creature-locust-corrupt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b2/Creature-locust-corrupt.png/195px-Creature-locust-corrupt.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b2/Creature-locust-corrupt.png/260px-Creature-locust-corrupt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde</b>\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ataque Base</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Nível de dano</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Habilidades</b>\n</td>\n<td>Subir paredes\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Gotas</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>nada</b>\n</td>\n<td><abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Mobs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mobs\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Multidões</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</div>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:250px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Locusta de bronze</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Locust.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/130px-Locust.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/195px-Locust.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/260px-Locust.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde</b>\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ataque Base</b>\n</td>\n<td>1.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Nível de dano</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Habilidades</b>\n</td>\n<td>Subir paredes\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Gotas</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>nada</b>\n</td>\n<td><abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Mobs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mobs\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Multidões</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><span id=\"Harvesting\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Colheita\">Colheita</span></h2>\n<p>Os restos de gafanhotos não podem ser colhidos como cadáveres de animais. Gafanhotos serrados deixam saques ao morrer, sem a necessidade de colher com uma faca. Gafanhotos de bronze e corruptos não deixam cair nada. Em vez disso, quebre os ninhos de gafanhotos para obter itens e impedir que mais gafanhotos apareçam lá.\n</p><p>Os ninhos podem ser destruídos com uma picareta e produzir: <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal_parts\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal parts\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/cf/Metal-parts.png/25px-Metal-parts.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/cf/Metal-parts.png/38px-Metal-parts.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/cf/Metal-parts.png/50px-Metal-parts.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal_parts\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal parts\">metal parts</a>, <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Twine\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Twine\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/6/6f/Flaxtwine.png/25px-Flaxtwine.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/6f/Flaxtwine.png/38px-Flaxtwine.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/6f/Flaxtwine.png/50px-Flaxtwine.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Twine\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Twine\">flax twine</a>, <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal_scraps\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal scraps\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/ce/Metal-scraps.png/25px-Metal-scraps.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/ce/Metal-scraps.png/38px-Metal-scraps.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/ce/Metal-scraps.png/50px-Metal-scraps.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Metal_scraps\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Metal scraps\">metal scraps</a> e <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Jonas_part\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Jonas part\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/9e/Jonasparts-tank01.png/25px-Jonasparts-tank01.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9e/Jonasparts-tank01.png/38px-Jonasparts-tank01.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9e/Jonasparts-tank01.png/50px-Jonasparts-tank01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Jonas_part\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Jonas part\">Jonas parts</a>.\n</p>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Locustnest-cage.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Ninho de gaiola\"><img alt=\"Ninho de gaiola\" src=\"/images/thumb/6/64/Locustnest-cage.png/120px-Locustnest-cage.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/64/Locustnest-cage.png/180px-Locustnest-cage.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/64/Locustnest-cage.png/240px-Locustnest-cage.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Ninho de gaiola</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Locustnest-stalagmite-main1.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Ninho principal de estalactites\"><img alt=\"Ninho principal de estalactites\" src=\"/images/thumb/a/a4/Locustnest-stalagmite-main1.png/120px-Locustnest-stalagmite-main1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a4/Locustnest-stalagmite-main1.png/180px-Locustnest-stalagmite-main1.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a4/Locustnest-stalagmite-main1.png/240px-Locustnest-stalagmite-main1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Ninho principal de estalactites</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Locustnest-stalagmite-small1.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Pequeno ninho de estalactites\"><img alt=\"Pequeno ninho de estalactites\" src=\"/images/thumb/3/3f/Locustnest-stalagmite-small1.png/120px-Locustnest-stalagmite-small1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/3f/Locustnest-stalagmite-small1.png/180px-Locustnest-stalagmite-small1.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/3f/Locustnest-stalagmite-small1.png/240px-Locustnest-stalagmite-small1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Pequeno ninho de estalactites</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Locustnest-stalagmite-small2.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Pequeno ninho metálico de estalactites\"><img alt=\"Pequeno ninho metálico de estalactites\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/43/Locustnest-stalagmite-small2.png/120px-Locustnest-stalagmite-small2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/43/Locustnest-stalagmite-small2.png/180px-Locustnest-stalagmite-small2.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/43/Locustnest-stalagmite-small2.png/240px-Locustnest-stalagmite-small2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Pequeno ninho metálico de estalactites</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span id=\"Behavior\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comportamento\">Comportamento</span></h2>\n<p>Os gafanhotos são encontrados no subsolo em grandes grupos junto com seus ninhos.\n</p><p><span id=\"Attacking&#95;the&#95;Player\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Atacando_o_jogador\">Atacando o jogador</span></h3>\n<p>Os gafanhotos tendem a permanecer em grupo na mesma área. Quando um jogador chega a 15 quarteirões de um Gafanhoto, ele começa a brilhar e a procurar o jogador, às vezes trazendo outros gafanhotos com ele. Os Gafanhotos de Bronze têm um ataque corpo a corpo que causa 1,5 de dano, os Corruptos causam 4. Eles atacam saltando, às vezes provocando o jogador.\n</p><p><span id=\"Helping&#95;the&#95;Player\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ajudando_o_jogador\">Ajudando o jogador</span></h3>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:250px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Locusta corrompida reprogramada</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-locust-corrupt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b2/Creature-locust-corrupt.png/130px-Creature-locust-corrupt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b2/Creature-locust-corrupt.png/195px-Creature-locust-corrupt.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b2/Creature-locust-corrupt.png/260px-Creature-locust-corrupt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde</b>\n</td>\n<td>36\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ataque Base</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Nível de dano</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Habilidades</b>\n</td>\n<td>Suba paredes<br />Defenda o jogador\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Mobs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mobs\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Multidões</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</div>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:250px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"TC\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Locusta de bronze reprogramada</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Locust.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/130px-Locust.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/195px-Locust.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/260px-Locust.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde</b>\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ataque Base</b>\n</td>\n<td>1.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Nível de dano</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Habilidades</b>\n</td>\n<td>Suba paredes<br />Defenda o jogador\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Mobs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mobs\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Multidões</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</div>\n<p><br />\nSe a classe do seu personagem for <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Classes#Clockmaker\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Classes\">Relojoeiro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Classes#Clockmaker\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Classes\"> </a></span>, você terá a habilidade exclusiva de criar e usar um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Tuning_spear\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Tuning spear\">Lança de Sintonização</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tuning_spear\" title=\"Tuning spear\"> </a></span>. Esta arma permite que você corte um gafanhoto de bronze ou um gafanhoto corrupto acertando-o uma vez.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Você não pode ter vários gafanhotos hackeados ao mesmo tempo.</li>\n<li>O gafanhoto hackeado irá segui-lo e defendê-lo de qualquer criatura que o ataque.</li>\n<li>Se você clicar com o botão direito no gafanhoto hackeado, você pode ordenar que ele espere ou siga. Você pode ver seu status em sua infobox.</li>\n<li>O gafanhoto hackeado pode se teletransportar para você se você correr muito rápido, se estiver no modo de acompanhamento.</li>\n<li>Se o gafanhoto hackeado for perdido ou morrer, você poderá hackear outro.</li>\n<li>O gafanhoto hackeado tem o mesmo poder <i>attack</i> que o gafanhoto normal, mas muito mais <i>health</i>.</li>\n<li>Você pode machucar seu gafanhoto hackeado se acertá-lo.</li>\n<li>O gafanhoto hackeado não se machuca se cair de uma grande altura.</li>\n<li>O gafanhoto hackeado pode “nadar”.</li>\n<li>O gafanhoto hackeado não irá segui-lo através de um translocador.</li>\n<li>O gafanhoto hackeado tem a capacidade de regenerar sua saúde ao longo do tempo.</li>\n<li>O gafanhoto hackeado às vezes emite um pouco de luz quando está escuro.</li>\n<li>Se você se reconectar ao jogo, o gafanhoto hackeado ainda estará lá.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Notes\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Observa.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Observações\">Observações</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3ria\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"História\">História</span></h2>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255,0,0,0.1); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #ff6666; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 50%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; text-align:center;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Book-normal-brickred.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/3/39/Book-normal-brickred.png/64px-Book-normal-brickred.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/39/Book-normal-brickred.png/96px-Book-normal-brickred.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/39/Book-normal-brickred.png/128px-Book-normal-brickred.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span><div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p><big><b>Spoilers à frente!</b></big><br />\nEsta página contém spoilers. Se você não quer que a história do jogo seja estragada, volte!\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\">\n<p>Gafanhotos são retratados em uma das tapeçarias <i>Schematic</i>, conforme mostrado à direita. A descrição da tapeçaria os descreve como “um dispositivo para cavar e organizar materiais” e “um pequeno ajudante”.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Schematic-a.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/d/d8/Schematic-a.png/200px-Schematic-a.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/d8/Schematic-a.png/300px-Schematic-a.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/d8/Schematic-a.png/400px-Schematic-a.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"640\" data-file-height=\"640\" /></a><figcaption><i>Um dispositivo para cavar e organizar materiais. Pense nisso como um pequeno ajudante.</i> Um de seus primeiros autômatos. Eram coisinhas precoces, sempre nervosas. Muitos de nós os tomamos como animais de estimação: um companheiro alegre para a oficina ou escavação.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Os gafanhotos podem ter sido criados pelo inventor Jonas Falx. Ainda não se sabe por que eles se rebelaram contra os humanos.\n</p><p>Jonas Falx é um personagem muito importante na história do jogo. Vários livros de história mencionam seu nome, mas o mais importante de tudo é a narrativa em cinco partes intitulada <i><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Lore_book#Reflection\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Lore book\">Ponderação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Lore_book#Reflection\" title=\"Lore book\"> </a></span></i>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Entidades</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Passivo</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\">Borboleta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Deer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Deer\">Veado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Deer\" title=\"Deer\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Gazelle\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Gazelle\">Gazela</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Gazelle\" title=\"Gazelle\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLan